  "structure": {
    "block_count": 56,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "20 Winter Baby Names for Your Little Snow Angel",
        "text_sha256": "53bdc91d13eb4c1c647cd81023b39d06b3556b69cda90e0ae5947f8c1f1a4869",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Updates to copy, sources, and formatting.",
        "text_sha256": "2bf448333081ffc8549a45a6c4b7fc711ee4b93575f0fffd3c4a6212c13581c2",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "winter baby names",
        "text_sha256": "69f413603b8a3655ce05604675b52a844be8549c09b684cc3a87c54864be87d2",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Looking for a winter-themed name for your baby boy or girl? Check out these beautiful baby names inspired by snow, evergreen forests, and other seasonal motifs.",
        "text_sha256": "886f1f3262a3dc19dd530f67e9df2a12e0456830dab01b0d629aeeaf7734d0b6",
        "word_count": 26
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If your winter due date is fast approaching — or you just love the cheer of the season — a winter-inspired baby names will evoke the coziest time of year. Check out these winter names for your bundled-up bundle of joy.",
        "text_sha256": "99820ab90bf79f03a1b3e599b87c4a74242dd52751faa4742ed0fe3a60878f0b",
        "word_count": 41
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Aspen. Like the wintry Aspen tree and the posh Colorado ski resort, this English baby name works equally well for boys and girls.",
        "text_sha256": "17dcaef4d3f3b9ae66d2503d2d5f47d41892ed1db3495469302c0b2b0b999453",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Branch. A Latin boy’s name for paw, claw, or tree branch — all reminiscent of a stroll through a wintry forest. And if you're a Trolls movie buff, you have another reason to choose this one!",
        "text_sha256": "ef644d472c8f34bb0a4905ea44071f1e8b8237b6bc412c9018a0d0c7f91ec2d5",
        "word_count": 36
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Clark. As in Griswald from the movie Christmas Vacation ! Clark is a gorgeous, unisex baby name choice that means “cleric or scholar\" in the French tradition.",
        "text_sha256": "a6ce3fbdef73caf1cb233b49e3f8f7508ac0bdcf2d9c3c1fc9c217c442a08d7e",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Eira. This pretty Welsh name for \"snow\" makes the perfect short-and-sweet choice for your little girl.",
        "text_sha256": "cb48a5e1152d99fb4f8cc973f59046ff25f4c3f4047180a4ce40bb4e80ca8933",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Elsa. Meaning “noble” in German, this name is short for Elizabeth, or “consecrated to God,” in Hebrew. If you’re a Frozen fan, this is a gorgeous moniker for your little snow queen.",
        "text_sha256": "29ba9a72d44cbd2178a14c340d4037e88fb1b5f2b48490b847190d1daad462ff",
        "word_count": 32
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Ember. This one conjures up images of a warm and toasty fire and is a unique choice for a fiery little girl. It's the French version of the English name Amber.",
        "text_sha256": "70d6571f2ac9681e484e97ec177e0afeb1b59ecae75041da4329d78777ab0ea8",
        "word_count": 31
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Farr. We love this modern, jet-setter English boy’s name that means “traveler,” just like the three wise men. For a more formal-sounding variation, try Farren or Farron.",
        "text_sha256": "16cbbf403b959acb2eeb25bc339832843c3bd6ae716fef1752afe071430d6e4c",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Fraser. As in the fir tree, Fraser is a lovely baby name for a boy born in the winter months. You'll love the meaning even more: \"strawberry\" in French (“fraise”) or “curly-haired” in the English tradition.",
        "text_sha256": "436db2cef5964fee142068a233d8d720950146c5c3f23f29a44e95a2c2509f85",
        "word_count": 36
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Holly. Nothing says holiday cheer like the name Holly. For a boy, try Hollis, which is an English name meaning \"near the holly bushes.\"",
        "text_sha256": "c61054377fb0cf26023184425e0b29a076b94cc214a2e53b47e21c249e234181",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "January. Actress January Jones may have made it famous, but it's still unique enough not to be too trendy.",
        "text_sha256": "72f875d21f26e49ddf3f8dcd7f0f78e15ba473b251875062225b42b77bdaca2d",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Izar. A one-of-a-kind Basque girl's name meaning “star,” like the Star of Bethlehem leading the three wise men. You might also like the variations Izarra or Izarre.",
        "text_sha256": "fdf40f28216a4af40e0b1ce1ed030dd465b734a51d0d6e3f33f4497ce259dc8c",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Browse baby names by style and origin with the What to Expect app .",
        "text_sha256": "185e28ff903da97b40f23dc40efdff9bac4ee5be01c8419be89a8c4f00b9613b",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Lumi. A good choice for your little boy or girl that's the literal translation for “snow” in Finnish.",
        "text_sha256": "1060126a553bd07a77931b8761e0122c98c6264767209152c073956fc7a42c11",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Mac. The baby name Mac pays homage to the Maccabees, Jewish rebels celebrated each year at Hanukkah; Mac is also a Scottish name meaning \"son.\"",
        "text_sha256": "adb080491e29caeac666b91cd5f48e0a81fd0257b0d93ae92f47c84960dd5fb1",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Nicholas. Jolly old St. Nick, the patron saint of kids, inspires this baby name. It means \"victorious people\" in the Greek tradition.",
        "text_sha256": "996c04a1e0894111e7fbd865e4dcf2490b6a5de6058b0d43335028657441d7df",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Neva. A baby girl name in the Spanish tradition for snow (nieve) — or “new” in English — this is also a river in Russia near St. Petersburg.",
        "text_sha256": "49f9c2de9cf6f3dab416c57c0e940ca802da1f57bbecc78247fc0a33b9af05ad",
        "word_count": 28
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Noel. Another holiday-inspired moniker, this French baby girl and boy name (often spelled \"Noelle\" for a girl) means \"day of Christ’s birth.\"",
        "text_sha256": "dc7187b206f517863135188e694a126427102703ca3e6ab3a427c78d47ba4924",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Olwen. This pretty Welsh baby girl’s name means “white footprint” — a lovely image for a snowy winter day.",
        "text_sha256": "7434f1bcd7064d330fcc6b163f2396b53b2710b1c84cbac96874171332a47c3b",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Vale. Although Vail is the name of the popular winter skiing destination, this alternate gender-neutral spelling English name also brings to mind wintry scenes and means \"valley.\"",
        "text_sha256": "498d5c8da95e4e7502af2c20c1ee42ec46d626545f3fcff33411c97ff2f190d0",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Wynter. This super cool baby name, meaning “winter” in the English tradition, works equally well for a little boy or girl snow bunny. Cute nickname: Wynn!",
        "text_sha256": "f2674044c1fead16aa135ff5d02fc8a41fa5762cd3ced042d58cdd9f4d61e40d",
        "word_count": 26
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Yule. If you love Christmas-sounding names, \"yule\" love this unique unisex name. It’s English for \"born at Christmas.”",
        "text_sha256": "2c027e923c7b21e6b8b2ed82c6933cd5d0febe84b55b7eb48f38502d9d72319b",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Baby Name Finder",
        "text_sha256": "72c80a950c6a114fa5b95493e11cb671fc8920c83b687533b115046fe13423d2",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Get inspiration to find for the perfect baby name.",
        "text_sha256": "6e635e823fcd9adbb539feb7fb257bf9aee973e9eda6f805253d7e1104112370",
        "word_count": 9
